WEBVTT

00:09:26.372 --> 00:09:30.293
Emma needed a better life,
and I knew this was her chance.

00:09:31.761 --> 00:09:34.633
I had learned too much
since I first worked with Alex

00:09:34.657 --> 00:09:38.243
to just sit there
while Emma's defining decade

00:09:38.267 --> 00:09:39.740
went parading by.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.103
So over the next weeks and months,

00:09:43.127 --> 00:09:45.650
I told Emma three things

00:09:45.674 --> 00:09:48.809
that every twentysomething,
male or female,

00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:50.481
deserves to hear.

00:09:51.984 --> 00:09:55.982
First, I told Emma to forget
about having an identity crisis

00:09:56.006 --> 00:09:58.353
and get some identity capital.

00:09:59.273 --> 00:10:00.923
By "get identity capital,"